g**\\\"}]}\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"No compliant test change was made.\\n\\n`ConstantsTest` already executes `Constants.checkAsmExperimental` and the JVM agent records the resource lookup. Native Image statically resolves the visitor class resource, so runtime dynamic-access tracing still reports the call site as uncovered.\\n\\nForcing a runtime-observable lookup would require dynamically defining/loading a visitor class through a custom class loader, which is forbidden by §root/FS-test-contract.4.5. The call site should remain uncovered rather than adding a non-compliant test. No tests were run.\", \"textSignature\": \"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0d8dfae50aa42668016ace2547abc887d1b025cb5db5f76974\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"}], \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\", \"provider\": \"openai-codex\", \"model\": \"gpt-5.6-sol\", \"usage\": {\"input\": 3389, \"output\": 1147, \"cacheRead\": 79360, \"cacheWrite\": 0, \"reasoning\": 1034, \"totalTokens\": 83896, \"cost\": {\"input\": 0, \"output\": 0, \"cacheRead\": 0, \"cacheWrite\": 0, \"total\": 0}}, \"stopReason\": \"stop\", \"timestamp\": 1791894824804, \"responseId\": \"resp_0d8dfae50aa42668016ace252c1bdc87d1bc0d289054300098\", \"rawStopReason\": \"completed\"}, \"toolResults\": []}", "truncated": true, "truncatedBy": "bytes", "totalLines": 260, "totalBytes": 307089, "outputLines": 7, "outputBytes": 41732, "lastLinePartial": false, "firstLineExceedsLimit": false, "maxLines": 2000, "maxBytes": 51200}, "fullOutputPath": "/tmp/pi-bash-9308ff9bb691a268.log"}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1791895211988}, {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_wQN78LbPSXeC7qLhECp5lOhO|fc_0ff252739ef20759016ace26aae91487d1bea2b164a1de23e0", "toolName": "bash", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Relevant status strings in Forge process logs/files:\nforge/docs/roadmap.md:361:  `native_trace_gate()`, `generate_tests()`, `local_ci_check()`,\nforge/docs/functional-spec/functional-spec.md:638:`run_workflow_en